{"id":"elon","name":"Elon","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:elon"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Elon","text":"Oak. (1.) A city of Dan (Josh. 19:43). (2.) A Hittite, father of Bashemath, Esau’s wife (Gen. 26:34). (3.) One of the sons of Zebulun (Gen. 46:14). (4.) The eleventh of the Hebrew judges. He held office for ten years (Judg. 12:11, 12). He is called the Zebulonite."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H356","lemma":"אֵילוֹן","xlit":"ʼÊylôwn","gloss":"Elon, the name of a place in Palestine, and also of one","kjv":"Elon","count":7,"share":1},{"strong":"H2074","lemma":"זְבוּלוּן","xlit":"Zᵉbûwlûwn","gloss":"Zebulon, a son of Jacob","kjv":"Zebulun","count":3,"share":0.43},{"strong":"H5624","lemma":"סֶרֶד","xlit":"Çered","gloss":"Sered, an Israelite","kjv":"Sered","count":2,"share":0.29},{"strong":"H3177","lemma":"יַחְלְאֵל","xlit":"Yachlᵉʼêl","gloss":"Jachleel, an Israelite","kjv":"Jahleel","count":2,"share":0.29},{"strong":"H2075","lemma":"זְבוּלֹנִי","xlit":"Zᵉbûwlônîy","gloss":"a Zebulonite or descendant of Zebulun","kjv":"Zebulonite","count":2,"share":0.29},{"strong":"H2850","lemma":"חִתִּי","xlit":"Chittîy","gloss":"a Chittite, or descendant of Cheth","kjv":"Hittite, Hittities","count":2,"share":0.29}],"verses":["Gen.26.34","Gen.36.2","Gen.46.14","Num.26.26","Josh.19.43","Judg.12.11","Judg.12.12"],"related":[{"id":"zebulun-the-tribe-of","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.06,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"issachar","type":"lexical","strong":"H2074","why":"both lead with זְבוּלוּן (H2074)"},{"id":"naphtali","type":"lexical","strong":"H2074","why":"both lead with זְבוּלוּן (H2074)"},{"id":"naphtali-the-tribe-of","type":"lexical","strong":"H2074","why":"both lead with זְבוּלוּן (H2074)"},{"id":"zebulun","type":"lexical","strong":"H2074","why":"both lead with זְבוּלוּן (H2074)"},{"id":"zebulun-the-tribe-of","type":"lexical","strong":"H2074","why":"both lead with זְבוּלוּן (H2074)"}],"works":[{"work":"anf02","